# Planted: the hour keys are out of order, and a weather key sits after a later key in the file.
# The markers at the ends of the lines are what scene_check.py selftest expects the lint to say about that line.
scene bad-order
world hour 16 weather nice
at 6 hour 18
at 2 hour 17     #! expect error hour key at t=2.00 comes after line
at 3 weather cloudy     #! expect warning comes after line
end 10
